/NUEVOS_EXPERIMENTOS.md

# Generated renders and preview images
paper/page_*.png
paper/audit_crop.png
paper/figs_v2/*.png
data/_*.json
data/_*.pdf
# Exception to "data/*.json is evidence": the CLI contract test runs c4_endgame.py
# at seed 987 and lets it write its roots suite here. The test removes it in a
# finally, but an interrupted run leaves it behind and `git add data` then commits
# a two-root scratch file as if a measurement produced it.
data/c4_endgame_roots_*_s987.json

# data/*.json are paper evidence and MUST be tracked.
# paper/paper_v2.tex, paper/paper_v2.pdf and paper/figs_v2/*.pdf are tracked.
